What is Disposable Plastic Cutlery?
Disposable plastic cutlery consists of single-use utensils manufactured from various plastic polymers, primarily designed for hygiene and convenience in food service applications. These products—including plastic forks, spoons, knives, and specialized items like sporks—are widely utilized across quick-service restaurants, catering services, airlines, and households. The market thrives on cost-efficiency and operational simplicity, though sustainability challenges persist.

